 "notes": [
  "Byline 'John \"Hunta.Waya\" Smith' uses the stock placeholder name John Smith, so the deck is credited as plain text to the handle Hunta.Waya with no player page. The handle resembles HuntaWarya (Brian Hunter), but they are not the same handle, so no link is made.",
  "No starting section was posted; the Objective and Prepared Defenses (listed under Interrupts) are taken as the starting cards. They count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'ISB Operations/Watch Your Step is Dead' dested ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents, the only ISB Operations objective (Watch Your Step is a Light objective; the back side name is as posted).",
  "Coruscant dested the Dark Special Edition system (the Coruscant set was not out in June 2001); Endor, Kessel, Sullust and Endor Landing Platform dested to the Dark printings.",
  "Secret Plans and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement were Effects in June 2001 (pre-Reflections III).",
  "Published title 'My fat @ss ISB deck' kept: a masked mild word."
 ],
